  "description": "Lieutenant General Leto Okeanos, the Mad Dog of the Navy, runs a tight ship… except when it comes to matters of the heart. He’s met his match in Captain Noah Bello, a fiery subordinate and old flame. When Leto blocks her long-awaited promotion, Noah challenges him to a duel. The wager? A wish granted to the winner. Leto wins and proposes marriage. Caught between duty, desire, and Navy politics, these ex-lovers must decide: is their love a second chance... or a disaster waiting to sink them both?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
